{"c":[{"id":"722003b2a2f2f406","sum":"niko-core stays; Progress Tracking out. L4 preflight: progress.md Level 4, not milestones.md. Sub-runs keep milestones.md, L2/L3 TDD bar. Done/risks/refs: milestones.md or projectbrief.md; Step 2a deletes tasks.md and progress.md. L2/L3 share a bar; L4 sibling in niko-preflight.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"f2c538954be02f23","sum":"niko-core stays when a workflow restates it. Progress Tracking stays out of niko-core; task lists are Niko-workflow only. L4 preflight dispatches on progress.md Complexity Level 4, not milestones.md: sub-runs keep milestones.md and still need the L2/L3 TDD bar.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260903T020823Z-863b2cb139a2db13","text":"niko-core is the omnipresent baseline: do not strip it because a workflow restates the same idea. Progress Tracking stays out of niko-core — task lists are Niko-workflow only.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260912T163802Z-128a4d11c5b57281","text":"L4 preflight must dispatch on progress.md Complexity Level 4, not milestones.md presence: sub-runs keep milestones.md and still need the L2/L3 TDD bar.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b0930c512db1fec0","sum":"L4 done, risks, and ticket refs live in milestones.md or projectbrief.md: Step 2a deletes tasks.md and progress.md. Preflight and QA are spawnable, one-line bootstrap, not routers. L2 and L3 share one preflight bar; L4 is a sibling reference in niko-preflight.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260912T163805Z-74c7fba4792433f6","text":"L4 per-milestone done, risks, and ticket refs must live in milestones.md or projectbrief.md: /niko Step 2a deletes tasks.md and progress.md before later milestones run.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260912T164808Z-b70c7feb534b80b1","text":"Preflight and QA stay spawnable skills with a one-line Run the skill bootstrap; they are not plan/build workflow routers. L2 and L3 share one preflight bar; L4 is a sibling reference inside niko-preflight.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8a11870eed5512b0","sum":"always-tdd: in-scope=user-observable breakage, preflight FAILs on that not plan label; out=repo bootstrap, not agent prompts; rules w/ evals stay TDD (#123). Niko skill refs in rulesets/niko/skills/; topic skills in rules/, symlinked. L4 Execution Order serial-safe; charts agree.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"c38cc7df7755cb76","sum":"always-tdd in-scope is user-observable breakage; preflight FAILs on that test, not the plan label (#123). Niko workflow skills keep references/ beside SKILL.md under rulesets/niko/skills/; topic skills live under rules/ and symlink into a ruleset.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260912T165056Z-1e3c090a0fc2764f","text":"always-tdd in-scope is behavior a user of this product can observe breaking (no CLI/workflow category list). Preflight classifies and FAILs on that test, not the plan's executable label (#123).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260912T170355Z-1e7e525d29c37eed","text":"Niko workflow skills keep references/ beside SKILL.md under rulesets/niko/skills/; topic skills still live under rules/ and symlink into a ruleset.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"9969d0d4099ef039","sum":"always-tdd out-of-scope is repository bootstrap (AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, copied init), not agent-facing prompts; rules with evals stay TDD (#123). L4 Execution Order is a serial-safe list; a flowchart's parallel sets must agree with it.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260912T171208Z-73d07cf3ecfc8407","text":"always-tdd out-of-scope is repository bootstrap (AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, copied init), not agent-facing prompts; product rules with evals would still be TDD (#123 rework).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260912T175124Z-ed6de308b249777f","text":"L4 Execution Order: the checklist is always a serial-safe walk (one-at-a-time never needs a later milestone); when work is not a line, the flowchart records parallel sets. Follow the list or the DAG; they must agree so a mid-project switch does not conflict.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
